        dcterms:description "Vendors `datasets/human_somite_organoid_clock/` with `scout_manifest.json`, `human_somite_organoid_clock_reference.json`, `human_somite_organoid_specimen.jpg`, `paper_citations.bib` (4 primary DOIs: `10.1038/s41586-019-1885-9`, `10.1126/science.aba7668`, `10.1038/s41586-022-05574-4`, `10.1038/s41586-022-05649-2`), and `README.md`, with runtime SHA-256 verification (`verify_dataset_integrity`, L88-115)." ;
